<mj-text font-size="17px" font-weight="600" padding-bottom="8px">
  You have been invited to {{storeName}}
</mj-text>

<mj-text>
  {{invitedBy}} has invited you to help run {{storeName}} as <strong>{{roles}}</strong>.
  Choose a password to activate your account.
</mj-text>

<mj-button href="{{acceptUrl}}" background-color="#0b3d2e" color="#ffffff"
           border-radius="6px" padding="20px 0" font-size="15px">
  Set my password
</mj-button>

<mj-text color="#52606d" font-size="13px">
  This invitation expires in {{expiresInHours}} hours and can be used once. If the button
  does not work, paste this into your browser:
</mj-text>

<mj-text color="#52606d" font-size="12px">
  {{acceptUrl}}
</mj-text>

<mj-text color="#7b8794" font-size="13px" padding-top="16px">
  If you were not expecting this, you can ignore it — the account cannot be used until a
  password is set.
</mj-text>
